        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lauren London, Chris Robinson, Dana Verde, Brandon Broussard, Gary Hardwick, Terrence J, Cassie Ventura, Paula Patton, Gary Coleman\n- Works: ATL, The Perfect Match, Scout's Honor, 90210, Entourage, The Game\n- Roles: actress, model, television personality, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Scout's Honor is a 1980 American made-for-television comedy-drama film starring Gary Coleman.\n- Lauren London was born on December 5, 1984, and she is an American film actress, model, television personality, and occasional television actress.\n- ATL is a 2006 American comedy-drama film and the feature film directorial debut of Chris Robinson.\n- Lauren London began her career in music videos before transitioning into film and television acting.\n- Lauren London earned recognition for her performance in the 2006 film ATL.\n- Lauren London also earned recognition for her work on the television shows 90210 and Entourage and for playing Kiera Whitaker on The Game.\n- The Perfect Match is a 2016 film written by Dana Verde, Brandon Broussard, and Gary Hardwick.\n- The Perfect Match stars Terrence J, Cassie Ventura, Lauren London, and Paula Patton.",
